    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1128">

                <pb facs="1315" n="1119" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1119"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860c.01/7–945: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1128<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-21T13:00:00-04:00">July 21, 1945—1 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6019. Department desires more information re agreement concluded between British
                    Treasury and former Polish Government at London assigning to former control of
                    latter’s assets, (urtel 6900 July 9<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1128-f1"/>).
                    Department is particularly interested in assets covered including any assets
                    outside Britain. Please request FonOff permission to reexamine document and
                    annex.</p>
                <p>For your information, Treasury Department has replaced licenses previously
                    granted Polish official agencies in United States permitting expenditures
                    without individual review with licenses which require advance notification to
                    Treasury of proposed transactions of these agencies. Payments to meet expenses
                    incurred by Polish official agencies in United States will for time being be
                    approved only after appropriate review.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                        <lb/> J[acques] J R[einstein] </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
